        "original_id": "242b23c1-b785-545e-bad1-bd3567a90661",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Herz, Lloyd Kaufman, Roland Emmerich\n- Companies: Troma Entertainment, Centropolis Entertainment\n- Products: The Toxic Avenger series, Tromeo and Juliet, The Noah's Ark Principle, Sgt. Kabukiman N.Y.P.D.\n\nFacts:\n- In 1984, Roland Emmerich began his work in the film industry by directing The Noah's Ark Principle as part of his university thesis.\n- In 1985, Roland Emmerich and his sister co-founded Centropolis Entertainment.\n- In 1990, Sgt. Kabukiman N.Y.P.D. was released as a superhero comedy film directed by Lloyd Kaufman and Michael Herz and distributed by Troma Entertainment.\n- Michael Herz and Lloyd Kaufman are the co-founders of Troma Entertainment.\n- Troma Entertainment is described as the world's longest-running independent film studio.\n- Troma Entertainment is known for comedic horror films including The Toxic Avenger series and Tromeo and Juliet.",
